# Ed25519 correctness (RFC 8032 sections 5.1.5 to 5.1.7): the signature of
# a message under the key of a seed verifies under the public key of that
# seed, for every seed and message. Stated here for a modulus p = 1 + mp and
# the facts of edwards25519 as hypotheses (p = 8 m + 5 below 2^255, the
# order l of the base point below 2^256); inst2.bend states it for the
# specification's verify, public_key and sign.

